        "kimat",
        "फीस",
        "शुल्क",
        "कीमत",
        "कितना",
        "कितने",
        "कितनी",
        "दाम",
        "கட்டணம்",
        "விலை",
        "என்ன விலை"
      ],
      "action": "ai",
      "kbFilter": "fee",
      "prompt": "The user is asking about fees. NEVER state any price, fee or amount - send the pricing message from the knowledge base, which diverts them to an executive call. Never state, split or confirm an installment amount, due date or schedule, even if they do the maths themselves and ask you to confirm it - offer the 2-installment option only and say our team will share the details."
